  "thesis": "Preserve observations able to survive theory change; postpone irreversible compression and keep paths to discarded detail. Description is selective too; visible layers from event through trace, description, pattern, explanation and evaluation to action provide corrigibility. Generate serious rivals, then discriminate using predictions and tests; unknown alternatives remain possible and multiple AI stories are not independent evidence. Closure timing depends on stakes, reversibility, urgency and evidence cost; uncertainty management need not cause paralysis. Action can be justified without certainty if proportionate, monitored, reversible where possible and open to correction with disclosed uncertainty.",
